---
---
<footer class="bg-[#FFF0F4]/80 border-t border-[#DF7591]/25 pt-16 pb-12 mt-auto relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Glowing subtle footer light -->
  <div class="absolute -bottom-16 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[600px] h-[180px] bg-[#DF7591]/15 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-12 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-8 mb-12 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Left Column: Logo & Tagline -->
    <div class="text-center md:text-left">
      <a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 group justify-center md:justify-start mb-4">
        <img src="/logo.png" alt="Luna & Brillo" class="w-10 h-10 object-contain rounded-xl hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300 shadow-3xs bg-white p-0.5 border border-[#DF7591]/30" />
        <span class="font-display font-bold text-xl tracking-tight bg-gradient-to-r from-[#70163C] to-[#DF7591] bg-clip-text text-transparent">Luna & Brillo</span>
      </a>
      <p class="text-xs text-[#7A5C68] font-medium max-w-sm leading-relaxed">
        Tu diario móvil de autocuidado integral. Ciclo menstrual, Modo Pareja en tiempo real, cronograma capilar inteligente, cosméticos y conectividad con Google Fit.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Middle: Quick Links -->
    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-6 text-xs font-bold text-[#70163C]">
      <a href="#" class="hover:underline">Inicio</a>
      <a href="#modo-pareja" class="hover:underline">Modo Pareja</a>
      <a href="/pareja.html" target="_blank" class="hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">
        <span>Visor Web</span>
        <span>↗</span>
      </a>
      <a href="#features" class="hover:underline">Nuevos Módulos</a>
      <a href="#widgets" class="hover:underline">Widget Android</a>
      <a href="#download" class="hover:underline">Descargar APK</a>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Column: Heartwarming reminder -->
    <div class="text-center md:text-right">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/80 border border-[#DF7591]/25 text-[10px] text-[#70163C] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 shadow-3xs">
        <span>💌 Recordatorio Diario</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs italic text-[#7A5C68] font-medium">
        "Recuerda brillar con tu propia luz, hoy y siempre."
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- Bottom Copyright and Tech Stack Credits -->
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-12 pt-8 border-t border-[#DF7591]/15 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4 text-[11px] text-[#7A5C68] font-semibold tracking-wide relative z-10">
    <p>
      &copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Luna & Brillo. Todos los derechos reservados.
    </p>
    
    <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
      <span>Desarrollado con todo el amor</span>
      <span class="text-rose-500 animate-pulse">💖</span>
      <span>por Tatiana Anacona</span>
    </div>
  </div>

</footer>
